## 6. Config to add (per plane)

```yaml
planes:
  - id: a
    url: "https://coder-a.example.com"              # ACCESS_URL / dashboard
    wildcard_url: "https://*.coder-a.example.com"   # WILDCARD_ACCESS_URL
    owner_token: "…"
```

Coder server must be started with matching:

- `CODER_ACCESS_URL=https://coder-a.example.com`
- `CODER_WILDCARD_ACCESS_URL=*.coder-a.example.com`

Lab already does this via sslip in [`../local-subdomain-lab/start-coder.sh`](../local-subdomain-lab/start-coder.sh).

